<title>UK: UK car production up 2.8 pct in 3mths to Oct.</title>
<headline>UK car production up 2.8 pct in 3mths to Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released the following data on UK car production in October-</p>
<p>CAR AND COMMERCIAL VEHICLE PRODUCTION - s/adj index numbers</p>
<p>					    3mth/3mth   3mth/3mth yr ago</p>
<p> Passenger cars total		   +2.8	     +18.4</p>
<p>		    for home market    -13.4	     -12.6</p>
<p>		    for exports	  +17.0	     +53.7</p>
<p> Commercial vehicles total	    -6.8		+0.5</p>
<p>		    for home market    -11.5	     -13.9</p>
<p>		    for exports	   -0.5	     +26.0</p>
</text>
